                                "sense_id": "ad5312e6-2556-3a4b-8a93-5dab6bdbf471",
                                "text": "And as Peter knocked at the door of the gate, a damsel came to hearken, named Rhoda. And when she knew Peter's voice, she opened not the gate for gladness, but ran in, and told how Peter stood before the gate."
                            },
