                                "sense_id": "ad5312e6-2556-3a4b-8a93-5dab6bdbf471",
                                "text": "'One little girl. Her name is Rhoda.'\n'What? Roader?' The others all looked suspicious of a name nobody had ever heard.\n'It's in the Bible,' he said."
                            }
                        ]
